> SWIS API -> Control / Query / API
17774 = SolarWinds Information Service (SWIS) API
This is the management and query API used for:

IPAM queries 
Node & interface metadata
Status updates
Automation & integrations
REST / JSON queries (tested successfully)

> Agent communication channel -> Telemetry / Agent data
17778 = SolarWinds Agent → Orion communication
Used for:

Agent check‑ins
Metrics upload
Registration
Heartbeat

> IPAM status
1 → Used
2 → Available
4 → Reserved
8 → Transient


> list one IP
 curl -k -u baloise:Wipro@123 \
  -X POST \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  https://172.17.66.121:17774/SolarWinds/InformationService/v3/Json/Query \
  -d '{
    "query": "SELECT IPAddress, Status, MAC FROM IPAM.IPNode WHERE SubnetID = @subnet AND IPAddress = @ip",
    "parameters": {
      "subnet": 115,
      "ip": "172.17.77.16"
    }
  }'

> list by status
curl -k -u baloise:Wipro@123 \
  -X POST \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  https://172.17.66.121:17774/SolarWinds/InformationService/v3/Json/Query \
  -d '{
    "query": "SELECT IPAddress, Status, MAC FROM IPAM.IPNode WHERE SubnetID = @subnet AND Status = 1",
    "parameters": {
      "subnet": 115
    }
  }'
  
